  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Novel and practically relevant tool for retrospective digitisation of paper ECG archives, validated in a peer-reviewed npj Digital Medicine 2026 paper. 85 stars and active development from a Norwegian university hospital lab. However, the repository has no LICENSE file — the code's legal status is unclear (all-rights-reserved by default). The accompanying training dataset is separately licensed under Apache-2.0 on HuggingFace. Suitable for research evaluation; legal review required before production or redistribution use.",
